    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "Turns the crisp roll line of a tailored collar, made an open printable trim: sized to the garment and sewn in, with the printable part an open Yantra4D object — the whole finding repairable, made-to-measure, and free to make.",
      "es": "Convierte the crisp roll line of a tailored collar, made an open printable trim en algo abierto: dimensionado a la prenda y cosido, con la parte imprimible como objeto abierto de Yantra4D — todo el avío reparable, a la medida y libre de hacer."
    },
